'''Memory Erasure''' is a type of [[Spells|spell]], mostly used by the [[Knights Moralis]] to wipe the knowledge of [[Forbidden Magic|forbidden magic]] from it's perpetrators.

==Description==
Several variants of the spell are seen, though all are incredibly similar, with only minor additions such as an additional keystone setting them apart. The sigil at the center is made of concentric circles with a dot in the middle. Several hand-like keystones stem from it, and the circle also contains dot-shaped keystones. Unlike most glyphs, the memory erasure spells seen are all white on a black background, instead of drawn with ink on a surface.

As far as the effects of the different variants, four different kind of memory erasure spells are known. The first, used on [[Qifrey]] when he was young, totally wipes the mind of the one it is used on. The second wipes all memory of magic, and is the kind employed by the [[Knights Moralis]] most frequently. The third wipes all memory of a secret or conversation, used by Qifrey and potentially [[Mr. Nolnoa]], and the last wipes all memory of a person, mentioned by Tartah when he and Coco were discussing what would happen of the knights learned [[Coustas]] was a [[Brimmed Cap Group|brimmed cap]].

During the [[River Rescue Arc]], the spell can be seen growing short protrusions and reaching for [[Coco|Coco’s]] face, almost as if it was alive.
